    "List of courses for Erasmus+/Exchange students (ECTS Catalogue) | Univerzita Pardubice\nSkip to main content\nList of courses for Erasmus+/Exchange students (ECTS Catalogue)\nEach faculty of the university offers its exchange students a number of subjects they can choose from. Every exchange student can also choose up to two subjects from any other faculty.\nFaculty of Economics and Administration\nFaculty of Transport Engineering\nFaculty of Arts and Philosophy\nFaculty of Chemical Technology\nFaculty of Health Studies\nFaculty of Electrical Engineering and Informatics\nFaculty of Restoration\nLanguage Center - courses\nUniversity of Pardubice\nMap\nContacts\n​\nContacts\nFaculties and Central Services and Facilites\nPanoramic view\nExchange/Erasmus+\nInternational students\nMagazine MY UPCE\nWebsite feedback\nServices\nAccommodation\nLibrary\nDepartment of Physical Education and Sports\nNostrification\nE-shop\nThe Centre for Technology  and Knowledge Transfer\nLanguage Centre\nGuidebook for Internationals\nEuropean University Alliance\n© 2023\nUniversity of Pardubice\n,\nStudentská 95\n,\n532 10\nPardubice 2\nPhone:\n+420 466 036 111, 466 036 112, 466 036 113\nWebmaster\n,\nRSS\nData box ID:\nf5vj9hu\nAccessibility Statement\nCC BY-NC-ND 4.0"
